              "upper": true,
              "native_dialogue": {
                "source_dat": "FDTXT_013",
                "string_index": 9,
                "utterance": 0,
                "control": "FFEF",
                "operand": 72,
                "pages": [
                  [
                    "『你們不是貝克威和珊嗎？",
                    "　還有好久不見的哈瓦那老爹",
                    "　幸好你們帶了幫手來，要不"
                  ],
                  [
                    "　然我們真會抵擋不住了。』"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "line": 1,
              "upper": true,
              "native_dialogue": {
                "source_dat": "FDTXT_013",
                "string_index": 9,
                "utterance": 1,
                "control": "FFEF",
                "operand": 72,
                "pages": [
                  [
                    "『不過，你們又怎麼會知道",
                    "　獸人大軍前來攻擊呢？』"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "line": 2,
              "upper": false,
              "native_dialogue": {
                "source_dat": "FDTXT_013",
                "string_index": 9,
                "utterance": 2,
                "control": "FFEE",
                "operand": 14,
                "pages": [
                  [
                    "『湊巧啦！",
                    "　還好這些朋友願意幫忙。",
                    "　城中的居民呢？』"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "line": 3,
              "upper": true,
              "native_dialogue": {
                "source_dat": "FDTXT_013",
                "string_index": 9,
                "utterance": 3,
                "control": "FFEF",
                "operand": 72,
                "pages": [
                  [
                    "『我們事先收到警告，",
                    "　居民都連夜撤到安全的地方",
                    "　去了。"
                  ],
                  [
                    "　不過聽說獸人大軍還在離哈",
                    "　斯米爾不遠的蘭迪平原駐紮",
                    "　眼前情勢仍然很險惡．．』"
                  ]
                ],
